{
  "slug": "shopify-ai-toolkit",
  "name": "Shopify Ai Toolkit",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Shopify's AI Toolkit provides 18 development skills for building on the Shopify platform, covering documentation search, API schema access, GraphQL and Liquid code validation, Hydrogen storefronts, Polaris UI extensions, store management via CLI, and onboarding guidance for both developers and merchants.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **22 skills**, **2 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (22): `shopify-admin` (Write or explain **Admin GraphQL** queries and mutations for apps and integrations that extend the Shopify admin), `shopify-app-pricing` (Merchant product subscriptions such as selling plans and subscription contracts use Admin, not App Pricing), `shopify-app-store-review` (Run a pre-submission compliance check against your Shopify app's codebase), `shopify-custom-data` (MUST be used first when prompts mention Metafields or Metaobjects), `shopify-customer` (The Customer Account API allows customers to access their own data including orders, payment methods, and addresses), `shopify-dev` (Search Shopify developer documentation across all APIs), `shopify-functions` (Shopify Functions allow developers to customize the backend logic that powers parts of Shopify), `shopify-hydrogen` (Hydrogen storefront implementation cookbooks), and 14 more\n- **Hooks** (2): `PostToolUse`, `UserPromptSubmit`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `.mcp.json`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install shopify-ai-toolkit@claude-plugins-official` from `Shopify/Shopify-AI-Toolkit`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 2,
    "hook": 2,
    "mcp": 1
  },
